     "tv",
     "te",
     "tf",
     "sum_c"
    ]
   },
   {
    "draw": [
     "pyr",
     "pdots"
    ],
    "speak": "Now a pyramid with a square base: five corners, eight edges, five faces."
   },
   {
    "draw": [
     "sum_p"
    ],
    "speak": "Two again. And it works for every solid without holes, however many sides it has."
   },
   {
    "draw": [
     "ball"
    ],
    "speak": "A football's panels: sixty corners, ninety edges, thirty-two faces. Two."
   },
   {
    "speak": "Leonhard Euler spotted the rule in 1750, and wrote about it to his friend Christian Goldbach.",
